    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2951" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκάρπ-ωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not made fruitful,
				uncultivated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.13.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρησμὸς ἀ</span>.
			<i>unfulfilled</i> oracle, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				714
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκας ἀκάρπωτον χάριν</span>
			because of some victory <i>which yielded her no tribute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				176
			</span></i>.</div>
